{"3987710": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Virtual ABC Journey", "steam_appid": 3987710, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Campus Exploration</strong>: There's no gameplay, no objectives — just a slow, nostalgic journey. Choose to stroll or glide through the campus from third-person or free-flying perspectives at your leisure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Memory Reborn</strong>: While inspired by our beloved alma mater, every scene and building is an artistic reinterpretation — not a literal replica, but a digital tribute crafted from memory and creativity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Gentle Invitation</strong>: Designed for anyone who cherishes their school days — this experience offers a sensory and emotional embrace that feels like home.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Disclaimer</strong><br>This project was developed by a student-led group of enthusiasts during their free time, and is not an official product. Inspired by our beloved campus, this work uses artistically reimagined scenes and architecture, not exact replicas, and is not affiliated with any educational institution. Should any copyright concerns arise, please contact us for resolution.</p>", "about_the_game": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Campus Exploration</strong>: There's no gameplay, no objectives — just a slow, nostalgic journey. Choose to stroll or glide through the campus from third-person or free-flying perspectives at your leisure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Memory Reborn</strong>: While inspired by our beloved alma mater, every scene and building is an artistic reinterpretation — not a literal replica, but a digital tribute crafted from memory and creativity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Gentle Invitation</strong>: Designed for anyone who 